	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• これから発明をはじめるキミに！",
			"• テレビ番組「ポチっと発明 ピカちんキット」に登場するピカちん大百科とポチローが入ったボリューム満点のスターターセットが登場！",
			"• これひとつあれば、発明品の情報をまとめるピカちん大百科と、おともロボのポチローが両方揃って、発明の準備は万端だ！",
			"• ピカちんキットを組み立てるための７つ道具もついてくるぞ！",
			"• ピカちん大百科に綴じられるピカちんシートも３枚入っている！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• For those of you who are just starting to invent!",
			"• Introducing a voluminous starter set that includes the Pikachin Encyclopedia and Pochiro that appear in the TV program \"Pochitto Invention Pikachin Kit\"!",
			"• With this one item, you will have both Pikachin Encyclopedia, which compiles information on inventions, and Otomo Robo Pochiro, and you will be ready to invent!",
			"• Also comes with 7 tools to assemble Pikachin Kit!",
			"• Also includes 3 Pikachin sheets that can be bound into the Pikachin Encyclopedia!"
		]
	},
